title Telemetry Ingestion Business Process

Simulator->Kafka: Publish Telemetry Event\n(topic: AssetLinkID-UtilityOperator)\nasset_type: BATTERY | SOLAR | EV_CHARGER

Kafka->Telemetry Service: Consume record
activate Telemetry Service
note right of Telemetry Service: Parse asset_type\nExtract relevant fields\nSet non-applicable fields to NULL

Telemetry Service->Database: INSERT INTO Telemetry\n(timeStamp, asset_id, asset_type, grid_cell_id, ...)
activate Database
Database-->Telemetry Service: OK
deactivate Database

Telemetry Service->Kafka: commitSync()
deactivate Telemetry Service
